  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.low5ORd87QeA9Oug]{Extract Element}</p><p>A kineticist has added some of your elemental matter to their kinetic aura. Their impulses bypass any immunity you have to their elemental trait or traits, and you take a –1 circumstance penalty to your saves and AC against their impulses. If you normally have a resistance that would apply to damage from one of their impulses, ignore that resistance; if you would normally be immune to that damage type, you instead have resistance equal to your level to damage from the impulse.</p><p>Lasts 5 minutes, or until the kineticist's kinetic aura ends.</p>"
